        {
          "name": "Collossus Unleashed!",
          "description": "On this day, Greencloak summoned the Collossus; Keid's former mentor Shanksworth attempted to take control of the Collossus for his own aims.  Both only partly succeeded, the Collossus now acting on its own will, the term used loosely.  Greencloak was rescued (read: skyhooked) away by Doc Furn.",
