          },
          "type": "Date"
        },
        {
          "name": "Mud's Dawn",
          "description": "Skyaian Wide Celebration of the Dawn of the Monsoon Season.  Because of the Strangeness of Biomes and Eldritch Stabilizing Entities, the recurrent rains are relied upon by most cities which have some version of vast reservoirs which are filled for the remainder of the year.",
