        },
        {
          "name": "The Great Stand",
          "description": "A ceremony by the surviving Pilgrims in Shreet upon their return. Only Pilgrims may attend, nothing is known about what happens during this ceremony.  Many pilgrims walk away having lost much of their sanity.",
