        {
          "name": "New Year's Eve",
          "description": "Marking the end of Spring and the beginning of the Monsoon months which are said to \"begin\" the year anew.  The unnatural cycles of Skyaia post-Cataclysm making it mostly arbitrary which boundary to assign.  It was seen early on as a good omen for the rainy months to celebrate as their arrival approached.  This seed of superstition carries on to this day.",
